OL,3,GNEWSARAF apologises after jets flown
OL,4,Alow over Lockerbie near bombing
OL,5,Aanniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Royal Air Force has apologised to
OL,8,Fthe residents of Lockerbie after
OL,9,Fmilitary jets were flown over the area
OL,10,Fclose to the anniversary of the deadly
OL,11,Fbombing.
OL,13,FA Pan-Am jumbo jet came down over the
OL,14,FDumfries and Galloway town in December
OL,15,F1988, killing all 259 people on board
OL,16,Fand 11 people on the ground.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
