OL,3,GNEWSARAF apologises after jets flown
OL,4,Alow over Lockerbie near bombing
OL,5,Aanniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FLocal MP David Mundell said there was
OL,8,Fan understanding in place after the
OL,9,Fattack that there would not be low
OL,10,Fflying over the community out of
OL,11,Frespect to residents, but reports
OL,12,Fsuggest this was broken on several
OL,13,Foccasions earlier this month.
OL,15,FThe RAF said it was sorry for any
OL,16,Fdistress caused, and that it was
OL,17,Finvestigating.
